WEBVTT

00:23.060 --> 00:27.042
Driving north on 81, the autumn leaves are

00:27.102 --> 00:32.063
golden red. My family is all around me, trying to

00:32.103 --> 00:36.945
clear my head. We're headed for the parkway,

00:37.025 --> 00:41.607
just a perfect normal day. Then we hit the sign at

00:41.747 --> 00:45.708
Lexington, the gauntlet's underway. The ghost

00:45.968 --> 00:50.890
is in the car again, the ghost is in the lane. Two

00:50.970 --> 00:55.395
blue shields side by side, her voice is in my

00:55.475 --> 01:00.440
brain. I-64, the eastbound sign, and 81 the

01:00.540 --> 01:05.545
north. I know the exits follow 81, but a road is

01:05.625 --> 01:10.330
pulling forth. This is the 30-mile gauntlet.

01:10.990 --> 01:16.134
i'm holding on so tight i'm trying to be normal

01:16.514 --> 01:20.497
i'm trying to win the fight but every sign is like

01:20.637 --> 01:26.382
a gun a reminder of a trap i'm just a passenger

01:26.902 --> 01:29.304
caught in the ring green map

01:35.800 --> 01:39.682
We're getting close to Stanton now. The split is

01:39.782 --> 01:46.746
coming fast. Exit 221, a test I have to pass. Mark

01:46.786 --> 01:51.509
just asked me, are you ready? I look him in the

01:52.109 --> 01:57.012
eye. I have to face this demon. I'm ready, I will

01:57.052 --> 02:01.034
try. We're on the ramp, the turn is made. A sign

02:01.094 --> 02:04.736
for Richmond East The world just stops, the

02:04.776 --> 02:09.018
light just fades The monster is unleashed It's

02:09.098 --> 02:13.560
her road, it's her prison It's the place I cannot

02:13.640 --> 02:19.102
be Get me off, get me off She's coming, she's got

02:19.142 --> 02:19.182
me

02:43.236 --> 02:48.118
System crash I-64

02:50.279 --> 02:58.884
That is not my name System crash She's at the door

03:01.749 --> 03:07.051
She's won the game I can't breathe, I can't see

03:07.351 --> 03:16.415
Get me out, get me free No, no, no, no

03:28.020 --> 03:28.420
Exit 91

